# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/67e6d27877c9cfd6b6dbc74bd852b10bdbe09c3c/Denemo/denemo_sv-reviewed-20260917.po
# Evidence-SHA256: e64f9fd0bc4a3eada5095276a86b1c58ee3d4464cf7ebf47872a5ce61bad8b37
# Source-evidence: {}
# Publication: reviewed-file-delivery
